  "description": "Positioned on the top floor of a sought-after complex, this unfurnished two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment offers comfortable, low-maintenance living with sweeping city views. Featuring an updated bathroom, contemporary white kitchen and light-filled open plan living, this home is perfectly located just moments from the Perth CBD, public transport and the vibrant Beaufort Street café precinct.<br/><br/>A Closer Look:<br/><br/>* Top floor two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment<br/>* Two spacious carpeted bedrooms<br/>* Updated bathroom with integrated laundry<br/>* Contemporary white kitchen<br/>* Open plan living and dining area<br/>* Tiled flooring throughout the living areas<br/>* Large enclosed balcony with stunning city views<br/>* Split system reverse cycle air-conditioning<br/>* One allocated car bay<br/>* Well-maintained complex surrounded by established gardens<br/><br/>The Neighbourhood Perks:<br/><br/>* Walking distance to the train station<br/>* Minutes from the Perth CBD<br/>* Close to the vibrant Beaufort Street café, dining and shopping precinct<br/>* Easy access to public transport<br/>* Nearby parks and recreational facilities<br/>* Conveniently located close to everyday amenities<br/>* Enjoy an exceptional inner-city lifestyle<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: The property listing may contain images which show furniture in the property, which may or may not be digitally staged. Prospective tenants must be aware that the property is being leased unfurnished.<br/><br/>12 month lease preferred<br/><br/>AVAILABLE 31 JULY 2026<br/><br/>Send your enquiry through today to arrange an appointment to view. Please ensure you are registered for any viewings to allow us to keep you updated of any changes.",
